on-arrival: sworcery = 1; {! 

window.setSworceryUI(true);
Q.sworcery_timer = 6;

!}

We are now in a sworcerous state, and may seek to release Sylvan sprites from their hiding places so as to set afoot a time of mIrAcLeS, I mean miracles.

@mind_log
max-choices: 1

The Megatome is great at picking up on psychic transmissions.

- #mind_reading

