title: Otto Braun
subtitle: Dreams...

I keep having these strange dreams featuring these three triangles, these "Trigons", these manifestations of cosmic geometry. Specifically, I feel like for whatever reason the orange one and the light blue one, I think they're called the Bright Moon and Dark Moon trigons, are stuck in my head. They keep messing up my Sburb session even though they have nothing to do with Homestuck. Like I'm just trying to chill in my Homestuck fanfic au here and these trigons have to come along to prospit and derse and mess everything up. It's not fair. I wish the other SPD politicians liked Homestucks. I tried to adopt a typing quirk and make a trollsona but Otto Wels called me a dork. :<

